# Taruvi skills — fetched latest on every `npm install` (postinstall), never
# committed, so installs stay reproducible and the tree never drifts.
# context7-mcp and the .kiro/skills symlink are NOT Taruvi skills — they stay tracked.
.agents/skills/
.codex/skills/taruvi-*
skills-lock.json

# Codex subagents — generated from .claude/agents/*.md on every `npm install`
# (postinstall, see scripts/generate-codex-agents.mjs). Source of truth is the
# .md files; never hand-edit or commit the generated .toml.
.codex/agents/

